  "body": "**Blocked by:** #201\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #201; #203 is the next sequential slice of the `mail-sync-hardening` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nRecognize a provider replacement only when the provider-reported attachment size is far smaller than the decoded message text implies and the decoded visible body contains the corresponding normalized Google Drive share URL. Preserve provider-rendered link/nearby label; fabricate no Files row/size. Do not duplicate ordinary links, CID assets, or real attachments.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No Drive API/file fetch.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Replacement URL/label retained, no Files item.\n- Ordinary Drive prose not duplicated.\n- Real attachment remains normal.\n- HTML/text fixtures pass.\n",
